1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,390
DEE Cognitive is an experimental
system oriented towards intelligence.

2
00:00:04,575 --> 00:00:07,555
It operates in a three-dimensional
computational universe.

3
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:09,530
It has already demonstrated
learning, memory,

4
00:00:09,565 --> 00:00:12,570
composition and
communication in specific trials.

5
00:00:12,775 --> 00:00:14,280
It is more than an idea.

6
00:00:14,370 --> 00:00:18,000
It aims to retain experience
and use it in new situations.

7
00:00:18,305 --> 00:00:21,235
Some capabilities already work together.

8
00:00:21,325 --> 00:00:22,205
Let us see how.

9
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:25,780
Each cell is a location.

10
00:00:25,875 --> 00:00:27,780
Its state contains information.

11
00:00:28,070 --> 00:00:31,275
The engine rules determine how
it changes when interacting.

12
00:00:31,525 --> 00:00:34,255
An input encounters an
existing organisation.

13
00:00:34,505 --> 00:00:38,295
Its interactions produce a result,
read at a defined location.

14
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:42,185
Here, physical means states
and interactions in the model.

15
00:00:42,405 --> 00:00:45,235
We are not showing particles
from the outside world.

16
00:00:48,225 --> 00:00:51,255
An organisation can continue
from its own history.

17
00:00:51,275 --> 00:00:55,255
New inputs encounter its previous
state, without starting from zero.

18
00:00:55,380 --> 00:00:58,635
It can be saved and reopened
with the necessary context.

19
00:00:58,875 --> 00:01:03,405
Persistence means using what is
retained and receiving new experiences,

20
00:01:03,450 --> 00:01:04,755
not learning without end.

21
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:11,830
In memory trials, an experience
changes relations within the world.

22
00:01:11,925 --> 00:01:15,355
A later query can use that change.

23
00:01:15,560 --> 00:01:20,790
Different histories are compared using the
same query to isolate the effect of learning.

24
00:01:20,945 --> 00:01:23,575
Association repertoires also exist,

25
00:01:23,700 --> 00:01:27,005
although retaining a state does
not always guarantee access.

26
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:34,080
In an integrated trial, a previously
learned association was revised.

27
00:01:34,150 --> 00:01:38,705
New inputs changed its response without
changing the rules of the universe.

28
00:01:38,905 --> 00:01:42,160
The other associations in the
tested panel remained available.

29
00:01:42,230 --> 00:01:44,485
This is selective revision in that trial,

30
00:01:44,625 --> 00:01:47,505
not a guarantee that all
knowledge will be preserved.

31
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:53,855
In composition, two contributions
formed a common product.

32
00:01:53,975 --> 00:01:57,355
That product was used in another
interaction within the same world.

33
00:01:57,425 --> 00:02:00,230
The case combines a history
of order and contact.

34
00:02:00,440 --> 00:02:03,345
Removing one contribution
changes the consequence.

35
00:02:03,415 --> 00:02:07,960
In this way, earlier relations
produce results that can be reused.

36
00:02:10,200 --> 00:02:14,265
In communication, information acquired
by one participant reached another

37
00:02:14,275 --> 00:02:17,080
and affected the receiver's later response.

38
00:02:17,125 --> 00:02:22,480
Controls with interrupted messages
or different content identify its effect.

39
00:02:22,525 --> 00:02:25,240
This demonstrates transmitting
and using information

40
00:02:25,250 --> 00:02:27,130
between defined participants,

41
00:02:27,205 --> 00:02:29,210
without claiming human conversation.

42
00:02:30,225 --> 00:02:33,005
Another trial connects
anticipation and querying.

43
00:02:33,100 --> 00:02:36,280
An earlier signal is compared
with current information.

44
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:39,675
The discrepancy leads to a
question within the world.

45
00:02:39,965 --> 00:02:44,170
The question accesses acquired
information that later contributes to a use.

46
00:02:44,320 --> 00:02:47,300
The investigator prepares
the opportunities and timing.

47
00:02:50,200 --> 00:02:54,270
In adaptation, the consequence
of an action changed a reference.

48
00:02:54,460 --> 00:02:58,540
That history influenced later actions
when faced with the same opportunity.

49
00:02:58,740 --> 00:03:01,595
Without the return, behaviour was different.

50
00:03:01,665 --> 00:03:05,145
In another trial, an output
acted on an external service,

51
00:03:05,165 --> 00:03:07,395
and its effect returned as experience.

52
00:03:11,200 --> 00:03:14,805
Learned regulation also appears
in another experimental profile.

53
00:03:14,850 --> 00:03:17,715
Different experiences changed
the direction of a pulse

54
00:03:17,725 --> 00:03:19,755
that acted on an interference,

55
00:03:19,795 --> 00:03:22,025
changing a functional consequence.

56
00:03:22,120 --> 00:03:26,570
This is local regulation: the geometry
and opportunities remain prepared.

57
00:03:26,625 --> 00:03:29,630
It does not demonstrate an autonomous
decision about when to regulate.

58
00:03:31,200 --> 00:03:35,605
In functional language, a signal becomes
associated with a use through experience.

59
00:03:35,675 --> 00:03:39,605
Later, the signal can
recover a related response.

60
00:03:39,650 --> 00:03:42,355
The program encodes words as inputs.

61
00:03:42,425 --> 00:03:46,005
The achievement is to acquire
and use specific relations,

62
00:03:46,060 --> 00:03:47,665
not to hold a free conversation.

63
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:54,900
In transfer, prior experience changed
the first action in another context,

64
00:03:55,075 --> 00:03:57,755
before receiving a new consequence there.

65
00:03:57,775 --> 00:04:00,530
With the opposite rule, it
could also be detrimental.

66
00:04:00,700 --> 00:04:03,330
History influences behaviour without
guaranteeing correct responses.

67
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:08,640
Other trials integrated multiple contributions,
with limits to access and continuity.

68
00:04:11,225 --> 00:04:14,430
These results come from identified trials.

69
00:04:14,590 --> 00:04:18,410
Cognitive already allows associations,
memory and comparison

70
00:04:18,420 --> 00:04:20,825
to be used in one instance
with its own continuity.

71
00:04:20,895 --> 00:04:22,525
Universe provides the dynamics;

72
00:04:22,570 --> 00:04:23,850
Thinking, the execution;

73
00:04:23,915 --> 00:04:26,545
and Cognitive, access and continuity.

74
00:04:26,590 --> 00:04:30,360
Integration exists, but does not
include all the experiments.

75
00:04:31,200 --> 00:04:33,585
DEE's interest lies in bringing
capabilities together

76
00:04:33,595 --> 00:04:36,075
within its own computational dynamics:

77
00:04:36,095 --> 00:04:38,200
retaining experience, revising it,

78
00:04:38,215 --> 00:04:40,420
combining it and using information.

79
00:04:40,515 --> 00:04:43,130
This basis enables exploration
of adaptive agents

80
00:04:43,140 --> 00:04:45,680
and new forms of memory and processing.

81
00:04:45,690 --> 00:04:49,795
Specific applications and advantages
must be evaluated through testing.

82
00:04:49,840 --> 00:04:54,730
DEE Cognitive: demonstrated capabilities,
an intelligent system in development.

83
00:04:54,805 --> 00:04:57,990
The invitation is to investigate,
reproduce and develop.

